{"id":244,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自律と共生で本質を追究する学園","feature_description":"広尾学園小石川中学校・高等学校は、自律と共生を教育理念に掲げ、世界の課題を自分ごととして捉える学びを進めています。知識だけでなく、ものごとの本質を追求する姿勢を重視し、多様な価値観の中で自分の未来を形づくる教育が特徴です。創立110年の村田学園と広尾学園の教育連携も示され、新しい学園としての方向性が確認できます。創立背景から学園のつながりも分かります。","clubs":[{"id":5278,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5279,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5280,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5281,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5282,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5283,"name":"ダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5284,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5285,"name":"eスポーツ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5286,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5287,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5288,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5289,"name":"理科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5290,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hiroo-koishikawa.ed.jp